        "answer": "Constructs reinsertion count/remaining-insertion text, collapse/wave timers, icons and redeployment child. Nonnil passenger count becomes text; reinsertion index callback computes collapse/count string, and collapseCount updates re-read that model. Timer callbacks call setupEndTimer with supplied nonnil deadlines. VisiblePandemic adds exact pandemic mode, VisibleWave adds wave-respawn setting, VisibleHotPursuit adds deposit mode, generic Visible requires remaining insertions; all retain show flag and literal HUD visibility conjunction. RedeployUnavailable requires no remaining insertions, show flag, HUD gates and collapseCount!=0. Subscriptions request state checks. Registers close, optional postload, returns self. HMH mode/settings/enum selection and real reinsertion/clock behavior remain conditional; named other-mode states are not global exclusions.",
